cent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<h3 id="tool-parameters" class="group">Tool parameters<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Tool parameters" id="_R_18v7cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>The toolset entry in the <code>tools</code> array accepts four parameters; the rules they share with the browser use toolset are listed under <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/tool-reference#client-toolsets">Client toolsets</a>.</p>
<div class="prose-scroll relative print:overflow-visible"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Required</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="docs-nowrap"><code>type</code></td><td class="docs-nowrap">Yes</td><td class=""><code>computer_toolset_20260801</code></td></tr><tr><td class="docs-nowrap"><code>configs</code></td><td class="docs-nowrap">No</td><td class="">Per-member settings keyed by member name; each member accepts <code>enabled</code> (default <code>true</code> for all 17, including <code>zoom</code>) and <code>defer_loading</code> (default <code>false</code>, for <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/tool-search-tool#deferred-tool-loading">tool search</a>), and members you omit keep their defaults.</td></tr><tr><td class="docs-nowrap"><code>cache_control</code></td><td class="docs-nowrap">No</td><td class=""><a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching">Prompt caching</a> breakpoint at the toolset definition; entry only. A breakpoint on any <code>tool_use</code> or <code>tool_result</code> block in a batch takes effect at the end of that batch; see <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/tool-use-with-prompt-caching#cache-control-on-tool-definitions">Tool use with prompt caching</a>.</td></tr><tr><td class="docs-nowrap"><code>allowed_callers</code></td><td class="docs-nowrap">No</td><td class="docs-nowrap"><code>[&quot;direct&quot;]</code> only.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>For example, this entry withholds <code>zoom</code> for an environment that doesn’t implement it and sets a cache breakpoint at the toolset definition:</p>
<div data-copy-scope="" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border bg-surface-2 print:[p+&amp;]:break-before-avoid group relative prose-block [&amp;&gt;[data-not-prose]]:mt-0"><div data-not-prose="true" tabindex="0" class="relative h-full py-4 pl-4 text-code overflow-x-auto focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 print:overflow-visible"><div class="inline-block min-w-full pr-4 print:block" data-code-source="" translate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line">{</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"computer_toolset_20260801"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "configs"</span>: {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">    "zoom"</span>: { <span class="l5 dc">"enabled"</span>: <span class="l1 d4">false</span> }</span>
<span class="line">  },</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "cache_control"</span>: { <span class="l5 dc">"type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"ephemeral"</span> }</span>
<span class="line">}</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 print:hidden opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:focus-within:opacity-100"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] text-muted" aria-label="Copy code" id="_R_t17cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div>
<p>If your agent loop can run only one action for each round trip, set <code>disable_parallel_tool_use</code> to <code>true</code> in <code>tool_choice</code>; Claude then returns at most one member <code>tool_use</code> block for each turn (see <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/parallel-tool-use#disable-parallel-tool-use">Disable parallel tool use</a>).</p>
<p>The entry rejects these parameters from earlier tool versions, and a request that includes any of them returns an <code>invalid_request_error</code>:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>name</code>: member names are fixed by the toolset version.</li>
<li><code>display_width_px</code>, <code>display_height_px</code>, and <code>display_number</code>: coordinates are always in the pixel space of the screenshots you return.</li>
<li><code>enable_zoom</code>: zoom is a member tool that you control through <code>configs</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p>The entry also can’t be declared in the same request as a <code>computer_20251124</code> entry or another tool named <code>computer</code>. For <code>strict</code>, <code>input_examples</code>, <code>defer_loading</code> placement, <code>tool_choice</code>, streaming, and caller restrictions, see <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/tool-reference#client-toolsets">Client toolsets</a>.</p>
<h3 id="combining-with-extended-thinking" class="group">Combining with thinking<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Combining with thinking" id="_R_193ncqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>To combine computer use with thinking, see <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/thinking">Thinking</a>.</p>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:initial] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>For the <code>computer_20251124</code> tool, internal benchmarking on the models that use it suggests these <code>effort</code> settings:</p><ul>
<li><strong>Claude Opus 4.7:</strong> use <code>high</code> as the default; use <code>low</code> for high-throughput or cost-sensitive workloads.</li>
<li><strong>Claude Sonnet 4.6 and Claude Opus 4.6:</strong> use <code>medium</code> as the default (best accuracy-to-cost ratio). Avoid <code>max</code>, which adds token cost without improving accuracy on UI tasks. On these models, <code>low</code> uses <em>fewer</em> output tokens than disabling thinking entirely (fewer mistakes mean fewer retries), making it a strong option for cost-sensitive loops.</li>
</ul></div></aside>
<h3 id="augmenting-computer-use-with-other-tools" class="group">Augmenting computer use with other tools<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Augmenting computer use with other tools" id="_R_1957cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>To add other tools alongside computer use, include them in the same <code>tools</code> array. The <a href="#quick-start">Quick start</a> section shows this pattern with the <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/bash-tool">bash tool</a> and <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/text-editor-tool">text editor tool</a>. You can add your own <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/define-tools">custom tool definitions</a> the same way.</p>
<p>For tasks that stay inside webpages, you can also <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/browser-use-tool#combine-with-other-tools">declare the browser use tool in the same request</a>. The two toolsets work independently, each in its own coordinate frame. The <code>toolset_name</code> value distinguishes calls to members that share a name, such as <code>screenshot</code> or <code>key</code>.</p>
<h3 id="build-a-custom-computer-use-environment" class="group">Build a custom computer use environment<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Build a custom computer use environment" id="_R_196ncqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>The <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-quickstarts/tree/main/computer-use-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">reference implementation</a> is meant to help you get started with computer use. It includes all of the components needed to have Claude use a computer. However, you can build your own environment for computer use to suit your needs. You need:</p>
<ul>
<li>A virtualized or containerized environment suitable for computer use with Claude</li>
<li>An implementation of the computer use tool’s actions</li>
<li>An agent loop that interacts with the Claude API and runs the <code>tool_use</code> results using your tool implementations</li>
<li>An API or UI that allows user input to start the agent loop</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="implement-the-computer-use-tool" class="group">Implement the computer use tool<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Implement the computer use tool" id="_R_1987cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>The computer use tool is implemented as a schema-less tool. When using this tool, you don’t need to provide an input schema as with other tools; the schema is built into Claude’s model and can’t be modified.</p>
<ol class="clear-end list-none p-0 [:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:mt-pad-xl" role="list"><li class="m-0 flex gap-md p-0"><div class="flex flex-col items-center" aria-hidden="true"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-fill-control font-sans text-body font-medium text-primary print:break-inside-avoid">1</span><span class="w-px flex-1 bg-border print:hidden"></span></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 pb-xl"><h3 class="mt-0 flex min-h-7 items-center">Set up your computing environment</h3><p>Create a virtual display or connect to an existing display that Claude interacts with. This typically involves setting up Xvfb (X Virtual Framebuffer) or similar technology.</p></div></li><li class="m-0 flex gap-md p-0"><div class="flex flex-col items-center" aria-hidden="true"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-fill-control font-sans text-body font-medium text-primary print:break-inside-avoid">2</span><span class="w-px flex-1 bg-border print:hidden"></span></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 pb-xl"><h3 class="mt-0 flex min-h-7 items-center">Implement action handlers</h3><p>Create functions to handle each action type that Claude might request:</p><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border bg-surface-2 print:[p+&amp;]:break-before-avoid group/codegroup prose-block"><div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" data-cds="Tabs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b px-4 py-1 print:break-after-avoid print:py-sm not-prose"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 text-caption text-muted"><div class="-my-1 min-w-0 overflow-x-auto py-1 u-hidden-scrollbar scroll-fade-x print:hidden"><div data-size="sm" class="contents"><div data-cds-part="scroll-pager-scroller" class="contents"><div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" role="tablist" aria-label="Code block tabs" data-print-language="Python" data-size="sm" class="flex items-center font-sans data-[