ver:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover data-[active]:text-primary data-[active]:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:before:shadow-focus data-[disabled]:opacity-disabled data-[disabled]:pointer-events-none stacks:[&amp;[data-active]:not([data-disabled])]:hover:before:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover">Go</button><button type="button" data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="false" id="base-ui-_R_qlbad97cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" class="relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-none h-control px-md cds-reset whitespace-nowrap select-none outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden bg-transparent text-body font-medium font-control text-muted before:absolute before:inset-y-0 before:inset-x-px before:rounded before:-z-[1] before:transition-shadow before:duration-fast [&amp;:not([data-active]):not([data-disabled])]:hover:text-secondary [&amp;:not([data-active]):not([data-disabled])]:hover:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover data-[active]:text-primary data-[active]:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:before:shadow-focus data-[disabled]:opacity-disabled data-[disabled]:pointer-events-none stacks:[&amp;[data-active]:not([data-disabled])]:hover:before:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover">Java</button><button type="button" data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="false" id="base-ui-_R_slbad97cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" class="relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-none h-control px-md cds-reset whitespace-nowrap select-none outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden bg-transparent text-body font-medium font-control text-muted before:absolute before:inset-y-0 before:inset-x-px before:rounded before:-z-[1] before:transition-shadow before:duration-fast [&amp;:not([data-active]):not([data-disabled])]:hover:text-secondary [&amp;:not([data-active]):not([data-disabled])]:hover:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover data-[active]:text-primary data-[active]:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:before:shadow-focus data-[disabled]:opacity-disabled data-[disabled]:pointer-events-none stacks:[&amp;[data-active]:not([data-disabled])]:hover:before:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover">PHP</button><button type="button" data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="false" id="base-ui-_R_ulbad97cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" class="relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-none h-control px-md cds-reset whitespace-nowrap select-none outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden bg-transparent text-body font-medium font-control text-muted before:absolute before:inset-y-0 before:inset-x-px before:rounded before:-z-[1] before:transition-shadow before:duration-fast [&amp;:not([data-active]):not([data-disabled])]:hover:text-secondary [&amp;:not([data-active]):not([data-disabled])]:hover:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover data-[active]:text-primary data-[active]:before:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:before:shadow-focus data-[disabled]:opacity-disabled data-[disabled]:pointer-events-none stacks:[&amp;[data-active]:not([data-disabled])]:hover:before:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover">Ruby</button></div></div></div></div><span class="hidden text-body font-medium text-primary print:block">Python</span></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 print:hidden"><span class="contents group-[:not(:has([data-code-source]))]/codegroup:hidden"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] text-muted" aria-label="Copy code" id="_R_7jad97cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></span></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" id="base-ui-_R_7ad97cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" role="tabpanel" tabindex="-1" data-index="-1" class="cds-reset outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden data-[ending-style]:hidden"><div data-not-prose="true" tabindex="0" class="relative h-full py-4 pl-4 text-code overflow-x-auto focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 print:overflow-visible"><div class="inline-block min-w-full pr-4 print:block" data-code-source="" translate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="l1">NOT_EXECUTED</span><span class="lk"> =</span><span class="l3 dn"> "Not executed: an earlier computer action in this turn failed."</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk d4">def</span><span class="li dt"> process_tool_calls</span>(<span class="dc">response</span>: Message) -&gt; list[ToolResultBlockParam]:</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">    """</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">    Run the computer actions in Claude's response in order and answer each</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">    one. After the first failure the rest are skipped, because Claude planned</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">    them assuming the earlier actions succeeded.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">    """</span></span>
<span class="line">    tool_results: list[ToolResultBlockParam] <span class="lk">=</span> []</span>
<span class="line">    failed <span class="lk">=</span><span class="l1 d4"> False</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">    for</span> block <span class="lk dl">in</span> response.content:</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lg d7">        # Only the computer toolset is declared; route other tools here if you add them</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">        if</span> block.type <span class="lk">!=</span><span class="l3 dn"> "tool_use"</span><span class="lk d4"> or</span> block.toolset_name <span class="lk">!=</span><span class="l3 dn"> "computer"</span>:</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">            continue</span></span>
<span class="line">        result: ToolResultBlockParam <span class="lk">=</span> {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">            "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"tool_result"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">            "tool_use_id"</span>: block.id,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">            "toolset_name"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"computer"</span>,</span>
<span class="line">        }</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">        if</span> failed:</span>
<span class="line">            result[<span class="l3 dn">"content"</span>] <span class="lk">=</span><span class="l1"> NOT_EXECUTED</span></span>
<span class="line">            result[<span class="l3 dn">"is_error"</span>] <span class="lk">=</span><span class="l1 d4"> True</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">        else</span>:</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">            try</span>:</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lg d7">                # A string, or a list of content blocks such as the screenshot image</span></span>
<span class="line">                result[<span class="l3 dn">"content"</span>] <span class="lk">=</span> handle_computer_action(block.name, block.input)</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">            except</span><span class="l1 d2"> Exception</span><span class="lk dl"> as</span> err:</span>
<span class="line">                result[<span class="l3 dn">"content"</span>] <span class="lk">=</span><span class="lk d4"> f</span><span class="l3 dn">"Error: </span><span class="lk d4">{</span>err<span class="lk d4">}</span><span class="l3 dn">"</span></span>
<span class="line">                result[<span class="l3 dn">"is_error"</span>] <span class="lk">=</span><span class="l1 d4"> True</span></span>
<span class="line">                failed <span class="lk">=</span><span class="l1 d4"> True</span></span>
<span class="line">        tool_results.append(result)</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lk dl">    return</span> tool_results</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li class="m-0 flex gap-md p-0"><div class="flex flex-col items-center" aria-hidden="true"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-fill-control font-sans text-body font-medium text-primary print:break-inside-avoid">4</span><span class="w-px flex-1 bg-border print:hidden"></span></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="mt-0 flex min-h-7 items-center">Implement the agent loop</h3><p>Wrap the two previous steps in a loop that sends the results back and repeats until Claude returns no member tool calls; <a href="#understanding-the-agentic-loop">Understand the agent loop</a> shows this loop.</p></div></li></ol>
<h3 id="handle-errors" class="group">Handle errors<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Handle errors" id="_R_199ncqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>Report a failed action to Claude as a <code>tool_result</code> with <code>is_error: true</code> and a short description, and include <code>&quot;toolset_name&quot;: &quot;computer&quot;</code> as on any other member result. If the failed action was part of a <a href="#batch-actions">batch action</a>, answer the remaining blocks in the batch with the halt text shown there instead of running them.</p>
<p>For example, when screenshot capture fails:</p>
<div data-copy-scope="" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border bg-surface-2 print:[p+&amp;]:break-before-avoid group relative prose-block [&amp;&gt;[data-not-prose]]:mt-0"><div data-not-prose="true" tabindex="0" class="relative h-full py-4 pl-4 text-code overflow-x-auto focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 print:overflow-visible"><div class="inline-block min-w-full pr-4 print:block" data-code-source="" translate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line">{</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "role"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"user"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "content"</span>: [</span>
<span class="line">    {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"tool_result"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "tool_use_id"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"toolu_01A09q90qw90lq917835lq9"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "toolset_name"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"computer"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "content"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Error: Failed to capture screenshot. Display may be locked or unavailable."</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "is_error"</span>: <span class="l1 d4">true</span></span>
<span class="line">    }</span>
<span class="line">  ]</span>
<span class="line">}</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 print:hidden opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:focus-within:opacity-100"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] text-muted" aria-label="Copy code" id="_R_tb7cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div>
<p>Use the same shape for coordinates outside the display bounds and for actions that fail to run, with a message that says what went wrong.</p>
<h3 id="handle-coordinate-scaling-for-higher-resolutions" class="group">Size screenshots to fit image limits<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Size screenshots to fit image limits" id="_R_19c7cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>Screenshots and zoom images that you return to the computer use toolset must already fit within your model’s <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/vision#evaluate-image-size">image size limits</a>: the toolset takes no display dimensions and the API doesn’t downscale for you, so an oversized <code>tool_result</code> image is rejected with a validation error. Because Claude returns coordinates in the pixel space of the image it receives, keep the scale factor you used so you can map those coordinates back to your screen.</p>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:initial] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>Limits vary by model. Claude Opus 4.7 and later models, including every model that supports <code>computer_toolset_20260801</code>, accept up to 2,576 pixels on the long edge and 4,784 visual tokens total (<code>⌈width / 28⌉ × ⌈height / 28⌉</code>, approximately 3.75 megapixels); earlier models accept up to 1,568 pixels on the long edge and approximately 1.15 megapixels total (see <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/vision#evaluate-image-size">Resolution and token cost</a> for each model’s tier). The following example uses the earlier-model 1,568 px / 1.15 MP limits. For a high-resolution-tier model, size to the visual-token limit rather than a pixel total, for example with the resize helper in <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/vision-coordinates#resize-your-image-before-uploading">Resize your image before uploading</a>.</p></div></aside>
<p>If your screen is larger than the limit, resize each screenshot before returning it and scale Claude’s returned coordinates back to the original screen space. Because the toolset takes no display dimensions, the resize and the coordinate scaling in your application code are all you need:</p>
<!-- -->
