low\"]}],\" for high-throughput or cost-sensitive workloads.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Claude Sonnet 4.6 and Claude Opus 4.6:\"]}],\" use \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"2\",{\"children\":[\"medium\"]}],\" as the default (best accuracy-to-cost ratio). Avoid \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"4\",{\"children\":[\"max\"]}],\", which adds token cost without improving accuracy on UI tasks. On these models, \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"6\",{\"children\":[\"low\"]}],\" uses \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"8\",{\"children\":[\"fewer\"]}],\" output tokens than disabling thinking entirely (fewer mistakes mean fewer retries), making it a strong option for cost-sensitive loops.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]]}]\nf3:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"147\",{\"id\":\"augmenting-computer-use-with-other-tools\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"Augmenting computer use with other tools\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Laf\",null,{\"id\":\"augmenting-computer-use-with-other-tools\",\"name\":\"Augmenting computer use with other tools\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\nf4:[\"$\",\"p\",\"149\",{\"children\":[\"To add other tools alongside computer use, include them in the same \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"tools\"]}],\" array. The \",[\"$\",\"$Lae\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"#quick-start\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Quick start\"]}],\" section shows this pattern with the \",[\"$\",\"$Lae\",\"5\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/bash-tool\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"bash tool\"]}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"$Lae\",\"7\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/text-editor-tool\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"text editor tool\"]}],\". You can add your own \",[\"$\",\"$Lae\",\"9\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/define-tools\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"custom tool definitions\"]}],\" the same way.\"]}]\nf5:[\"$\",\"p\",\"151\",{\"children\":[\"For tasks that stay inside webpages, you can also \",[\"$\",\"$Lae\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/browser-use-tool#combine-with-other-tools\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"declare the browser use tool in the same request\"]}],\". The two toolsets work independently, each in its own coordinate frame. The \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"toolset_name\"]}],\" value distinguishes calls to members that share a name, such as \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"screenshot\"]}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"key\"]}],\".\"]}]\nf6:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"153\",{\"id\":\"build-a-custom-computer-use-environment\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"Build a custom computer use environment\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Laf\",null,{\"id\":\"build-a-custom-computer-use-environment\",\"name\":\"Build a custom computer use environment\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\nf7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"155\",{\"children\":[\"The \",[\"$\",\"$Lae\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-quickstarts/tree/main/computer-use-demo\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"reference implementation\"]}],\" is meant to help you get started with computer use. It includes all of the components needed to have Claude use a computer. However, you can build your own environment for computer use to suit your needs. You need:\"]}]\nf8:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"157\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"A virtualized or containerized environment suitable for computer use with Claude\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"An implementation of the computer use tool’s actions\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"An agent loop that interacts with the Claude API and runs the \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"tool_use\"]}],\" results using your tool implementations\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"An API or UI that allows user input to start the agent loop\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\nf9:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"159\",{\"id\":\"implement-the-computer-use-tool\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"Implement the computer use tool\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Laf\",null,{\"id\":\"implement-the-computer-use-tool\",\"name\":\"Implement the computer use tool\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\nfa:[\"$\",\"p\",\"161\",{\"children\":[\"The computer use tool is implemented as a schema-less tool. When using this tool, you don’t need to provide an input schema as with other tools; the schema is built into Claude’s model and can’t be modified.\"]}]\n172:T1081,\u003cpre class=\"shiki\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lg d7\"\u003e# Placeholder image data; a real executor captures the screen and returns the PNG bytes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l1\"\u003ePLACEHOLDER_PNG\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk\"\u003e =\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e \"iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003edef\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"li dt\"\u003e capture_screenshot\u003c/span\u003e() -\u0026gt; list[ImageBlockParam]:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lg d7\"\u003e    # screenshot answers with an image block rather than text: return the result content list\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk dl\"\u003e    return\u003c/span\u003e [\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e        {\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e            \"type\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e\"image\"\u003c/span\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e            \"source\"\u003c/span\u003e: {\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e                \"type\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e\"base64\"\u003c/span\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e                \"media_type\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e\"image/png\"\u003c/span\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e                \"data\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"l1\"\u003ePLACEHOLDER_PNG\u003c/span\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e            },\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e        }\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e    ]\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003edef\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"li dt\"\u003e click\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan class=\"dc\"\u003ecoordinate\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l1 d4\"\u003eNone\u003c/span\u003e):\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk dl\"\u003e    if\u003c/span\u003e coordinate \u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003eis\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l1 d4\"\u003e None\u003c/span\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk dl\"\u003e        return\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e \"clicked at current cursor\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e    x, y \u003cspan class=\"lk\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e coordinate\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk dl\"\u003e    return\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e f\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e\"clicked at (\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003ex\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003ey\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e)\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003edef\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"li dt\"\u003e type_text\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan class=\"dc\"\u003etext\u003c/span\u003e):\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk dl\"\u003e    return\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e f\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e\"typed: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003etext\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk d4\"\u003edef\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"li dt\"\u003e handle_computer_action\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan class=\"dc\"\u003ename\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"dc\"\u003etool_input\u003c/span\u003e):\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lk dl\"\u003e 