\"children\":[\"computer-use-2025-01-24\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"Claude Sonnet 4.5 (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"deprecated\"]}],\"), Claude Haiku 4.5, Claude Opus 4.1 (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"retired, except on Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed) and Bedrock\"]}],\"), Claude Sonnet 4 (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"5\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"retired, except on Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed) and Bedrock\"]}],\"), and Claude Opus 4 (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"7\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"retired, except on Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed)\"]}],\")\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"docs-nowrap\",\"children\":[\"$L178\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n3c:o306,10b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"242\",{\"children\":[\"On Amazon Bedrock, Claude Opus 5.5, Claude Sonnet 5.5, and Claude Haiku 5.5 also accept the \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"computer_20251124\"]}],\" tool with the \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"computer-use-2025-11-24\"]}],\" beta header.\"]}]\n10c:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"244\",{\"children\":\"$undefined\"}]\n10d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"246\",{\"id\":\"understand-computer-use-limitations\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"Limitations\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L98\",null,{\"id\":\"understand-computer-use-limitations\",\"name\":\"Limitations\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\n3c:oc0c,10e:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"248\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Latency:\"]}],\" Computer use latency for human-AI interactions might be too slow compared with regular human-directed computer actions. Focus on use cases where speed isn’t critical (for example, background information gathering, automated software testing) in trusted environments.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Computer vision accuracy and reliability:\"]}],\" Claude might make mistakes or hallucinate when outputting specific coordinates while generating actions. Claude’s \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"2\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/thinking#summarized-thinking\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"summarized thinking\"]}],\" output can help you understand the model’s reasoning and identify potential issues; set \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"4\",{\"children\":[\"display: \\\"summarized\\\"\"]}],\" on the thinking configuration, because the models that support the toolset omit thinking text by default.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Tool selection accuracy and reliability:\"]}],\" Claude might make mistakes or hallucinate when selecting tools while generating actions or take unexpected actions to solve problems. Additionally, reliability might be lower when interacting with niche applications or multiple applications at once. Prompt the model carefully when requesting complex tasks.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Scrolling reliability:\"]}],\" The scroll action supports direction control (up, down, left, right) and a specified amount. In applications where scrolling doesn’t take effect, keyboard alternatives such as Page Down can help.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"9\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Spreadsheet interaction:\"]}],\" Use the fine-grained mouse control actions (\",[\"$\",\"code\",\"2\",{\"children\":[\"left_mouse_down\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"4\",{\"children\":[\"left_mouse_up\"]}],\") and modifier-key combinations to select individual cells. Complex spreadsheet operations might still require multiple attempts.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"11\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Account creation and content generation on social and communications platforms:\"]}],\" Although Claude visits websites, its ability to create accounts, generate and share content, or otherwise engage in human impersonation across social media websites and platforms is limited.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"13\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Vulnerabilities:\"]}],\" Jailbreaks and prompt injection can affect computer use as they can any frontier AI system, including through instructions embedded in webpages or images; apply the precautions in \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"2\",{\"href\":\"#security-considerations\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Security considerations\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"15\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Inappropriate or illegal actions:\"]}],\" Under Anthropic’s Terms of Service, you must not employ computer use to violate any laws or the Acceptable Use Policy.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n3c:o1000,10f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"250\",{\"children\":[\"Always carefully review and verify Claude’s computer use actions and logs. Do not use Claude for tasks requiring perfect precision or sensitive user information without human oversight.\"]}]\n110:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"252\",{\"id\":\"data-retention\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"Data retention\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L98\",null,{\"id\":\"data-retention\",\"name\":\"Data retention\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\n111:[\"$\",\"p\",\"254\",{\"children\":[\"Computer use is a client-side tool. All screenshots, mouse actions, keyboard inputs, and any files involved in a session are captured and stored in your environment, not by Anthropic. Anthropic processes the screenshot images and action requests in real time as part of the API call. Retention for those API requests is governed by \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/manage-claude/api-and-data-retention\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"API and data retention\"]}],\".\"]}]\n112:[\"$\",\"p\",\"256\",{\"children\":[\"Because your application controls where and how computer use data is stored, computer use is ZDR eligible.\"]}]\n113:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"258\",{\"id\":\"pricing\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"Pricing\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L98\",null,{\"id\":\"pricing\",\"name\":\"Pricing\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\n114:[\"$\",\"p\",\"260\",{\"children\":[\"Computer use follows the standard \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/overview#pricing\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"tool use pricing\"]}],\". When using the computer use tool:\"]}]\n115:[\"$\",\"p\",\"262\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"Toolset definition overhead:\"]}],\" Declaring \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"2\",{\"children\":[\"computer_toolset_20260801\"]}],\" with its default members adds about 4,500 input tokens to a request (about 4,590 on Claude Sonnet 5 and about 4,520 on the other supported models), which covers the member tool definitions and the tool use system prompt. Disabling \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"4\",{\"children\":[\"zoom\"]}],\" with \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"6\",{\"children\":[\"configs\"]}],\" removes about 410 of those tokens. The exact count for a request is reported in the response \",[\"